    {
      "name": "Table Habit",
      "bundleIdentifier": "io.github.friesi23.mhabit",
      "developerName": "FriesI23",
      "subtitle": "Open-source micro-habit tracker with WebDAV sync",
      "localizedDescription": "Table Habit is a free, open-source habit tracker for building micro habits: a scoring system grades consistency rather than raw streaks, growth charts show the trend, and everything syncs across devices through any WebDAV endpoint - Nextcloud, Koofr or a self-hosted one. Offline-first, no ads, no in-app purchases and no account required, licensed under Apache-2.0. The iOS build OmniSource tracks is the project's own unsigned IPA from its GitHub releases, which AltStore, SideStore, Feather and ESign sign with your certificate at install time.",
